  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India Challenge Enabling Fund (ICE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICE will support innovations, build evidence, share knowledge and technical expertise as pilots or strategic interventions to support the objectives of the India-UK road map and the Country Business Plan through ODA funding that supports development in India. It will aim to co-design interventions with Indian and UK institutions &#x2013; government, civil society, think tanks &#x2013; on specific questions/areas that will inform state/central policies, unlock resources, and promote sustainable and inclusive outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
